## **Description**
This is the third time I have had my log cabin chopped down completely with this mod. I created a backup before chopping a tree down, but for some reason in the backup, it still destroyed my cabin. I seriously want to keep this mod and enjoy it, but I really don't want to rebuild my cabin for the 4th time. I don't know what kind of checks you run to not destroy houses, but it doesn't work. The latest log is not when the tree was cut down. I was so frustrated I had to quit the game. Not sure if it will help, but it's there. 

