## **Description**
The mod keeps displaying the wolf 1500 blocks away from me, although the wolf is right next to me. This happened after the following events:

1 I tamed the wolf;
2 I put the wolf in the boat;
3 I sailed to the island;
4 I got out of the boat;
4.1 The wolf remained sitting in the boat;
5 I left the server;
6 I entered the server;
7 I got into the boat and sailed on business.

As a result, the mod constantly displays this wolf at the point where it remained in the boat near the island. Moreover, even if I tell the wolf to sit (I have no followers left), information about it does not get through.

I tried to exit and enter the server, I tried to sit/take the wolf with me before leaving the server, nothing changes.

Only a complete restart of the game helped.

